+
+##### Local DSH enhancement
+
+This local build targets DSH 0.2.2-rc.1. Its package-root `dsh-memory.config.json` supplies DSH
+file defaults before the user's global, harness, path and bank settings. The default is direct
+recall on every user message with independent conversation write-back; no new environment inputs
+are added. `autoInjectEveryTurns` resets the cached decision on turns 1, 1+N, 1+2N; 0 retains the
+original initial-retrieval policy. Empty and failed results may still retry between scheduled turns.
+Tool continuations do not retrieve again. The existing first-turn page-preamble behavior is retained.
+
+The DSH adapter provides a read-only `hindsightRuntime` service and emits `hindsight/observation`
+records for the companion manager. Inspection reads the already initialized workspace; it does
+not create a client or resume a historical session. Summaries report the current retrieval result,
+HTTP failures, fallback stages and elapsed time without adding Hindsight requests. The manager
+confirms memory-body submission from the host's committed message, independently of retrieval.
+These records contain no query or memory text and do not enter model context.
+
+Restart DSH after changing the saved configuration. The current runtime caches each workspace,
+so a new session in an existing workspace may still use its old values. The package declaration
+`dsh-enhancement.json` describes the installation; the running service reports the executing build.
 
